#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:4 9682baae9595482a8e0f61aedb58ef7b
msgid "用户注册"
msgstr "User registration"

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:7 a4ab4f67dece42d095e4b25dde9f4adc
msgid "流程目标"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:9 4897db128d7c435ebf3dc96a44a59a95
msgid "为首次使用平台、还没有账号的科研人员说明如何注册。已有账号的用户 请直接阅读下一章。"
msgstr ""
"Explain how researchers who are using the platform for the first time and do"
" not yet have an account can register. If you already have an account, go to"
" the next chapter."

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:13 9509df4f35f14db38ffc9a07aaedf896
msgid "进入方式"
msgstr "How to access"

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:15 a75425d9baed445199ed3ccb2c1619a7
msgid "在浏览器中打开平台网址 ``https://kylin.cnsrc.shao.ac.cn/Login/``， 进入登录页面。"
msgstr ""
"Open ``https://kylin.cnsrc.shao.ac.cn/Login/`` in your browser to reach the "
"login page."

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:18 4bd571b30ed4440fa134d5f47d0d8b87
msgid "在登录页点击 ``注册账号`` 按钮（位于页面底部，``登 录`` 和 ``Login with SSO`` 按钮下方）。"
msgstr ""
"On the login page, click ``Register`` (at the bottom, below ``Login`` and "
"``Login with SSO``)."

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:25 47954ae9af7145b28b0c0134ba59f683
msgid "登录页"
msgstr "Login page"

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:25 76813533a291412180a4270c5378fb69
msgid "登录页面。点击 ``注册账号`` 按钮进入注册流程。"
msgstr "Login page. Click ``Register`` to start registration."

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:28 6e583a76990044b4a197a4e3caf7f3db
msgid "页面内容"
msgstr "Page contents"

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:30 72043ef98fd14005ae164bda8dc8930d
msgid "注册页需要填写以下信息："
msgstr "On the registration page, fill in the following:"

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:32 04f7e41dc22a4b289581206370168375
msgid "``登录名``：用于登录的用户名，注册后不可修改。"
msgstr ""
"``Login name``: username for login; cannot be changed after registration."

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:33 aaa5d9f86300455f93ee94f881622a1d
msgid "``姓名``：真实姓名。"
msgstr "``Full name``: your real name."

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:34 0cdd4dac9e1041129066177e717c8c44
msgid "``邮箱``：用于接收平台通知、找回密码等。"
msgstr "``Email``: for platform notices and password recovery."

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:35 e6a4af23b56742c192118d007cbfc0e2
msgid "``类型``：下拉选择 ``学生`` 或 ``职工``。"
msgstr "``Type``: choose ``Student`` or ``Staff`` from the dropdown."

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:36 9704a95fa0634ea589b9a41975e100c9
msgid "``密码``：至少 8 位，必须同时包含大写字母、小写字母和数字。"
msgstr ""
"``Password``: at least 8 characters, with uppercase, lowercase, and digits."

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:37 2a153d9544264090b1f66349505361d4
msgid "``再次输入密码``：与上面密码一致。"
msgstr "``Confirm password``: must match the password above."

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:43 39cb0d7d511f48a5acceebe47ae8c108
msgid "注册页面"
msgstr "Registration page"

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:43 b94df10eff644fe4ad89a70ceffa8e15
msgid "注册页面，含登录名、姓名、邮箱、类型、密码、确认密码字段。"
msgstr ""
"Registration page with login name, name, email, type, password, and confirm-"
"password fields."

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:46 5cc37c6cea33416da69298913f9ffa29
msgid "注册流程"
msgstr "Registration steps"

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:48 7d4771822125438581cc7ecc4e5ac52f
msgid "在登录页底部点击 ``注册账号`` 按钮。"
msgstr "Click ``Register`` at the bottom of the login page."

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:49 45ac184583df49e287e14ef59ca71945
msgid "在注册页填写 ``登录名``、``姓名``、``邮箱``。"
msgstr ""
"On the registration page, fill in ``Login name``, ``Full name``, and "
"``Email``."

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:50 e62bcf3360e84eafad9416fd8b5989a6
msgid "在 ``类型`` 下拉中选择 ``学生`` 或 ``职工``。"
msgstr "In ``Type``, select ``Student`` or ``Staff``."

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:51 0709ae124861486d9af850ec78fecbd4
msgid "在 ``密码`` 框中输入符合要求的密码（≥8 位、含大小写字母和数字）。"
msgstr ""
"In ``Password``, enter a valid password (>=8 chars, with upper/lowercase and"
" digits)."

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:52 d8cd142287d144eba9e9f7a6d6c89159
msgid "在 ``再次输入密码`` 框中再次输入相同密码。"
msgstr "In ``Confirm password``, enter the same password again."

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:53 d6f23e6de39e4d7488d4d74c618bb307
msgid "点击 ``注 册`` 按钮提交。"
msgstr "Click ``Register`` to submit."

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:54 2b57f0552e8f4811ac2a6a480f70fba7
msgid "注册成功后，页面提示注册成功；如需立即登录可点击 ``返回登录`` 跳 回登录页，使用新账号登录。"
msgstr ""
"After successful registration, the page confirms success; click ``Back to "
"Login`` to return and sign in with the new account."

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:58 8291771da85c4edf911c8e25e9018597
msgid "注意事项"
msgstr "Notes"

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:62 2347c95c6b2f4d7a9e5c20ec4de98621
msgid "登录名是您后续登录和被其他用户识别的唯一标识，请谨慎选择。注册 后登录名通常不可修改。"
msgstr ""
"Your login name is your unique identifier for signing in and for other users"
" to recognize you; choose it carefully. It usually cannot be changed after "
"registration."

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:64 f2a04a011a0e48f4954e0b9343ba8323
msgid "密码需符合强度要求（至少 8 位、含大小写字母和数字），否则无法 提交。"
msgstr ""
"The password must meet the strength requirements (at least 8 characters with"
" uppercase, lowercase, and digits); otherwise submission will fail."

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:66 5be976b33f3a4b5c8bba0951bd2afe5f
msgid "注册成功后账号需要管理员审核（``启用``）后才能登录使用。如提 示 ``账号未启用`` 或 ``账号不存在``，请联系管理员处理。"
msgstr ""
"After registration, an admin must ``Enable`` the account before login. If "
"you see ``Account not enabled`` or ``Account does not exist``, contact an "
"administrator."

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:68 f45a7da4eb924ec4b44e354ab13cce78
msgid "如忘记密码，可使用登录页的密码重置功能（如果平台开放），或联 系管理员重置。"
msgstr ""
"If you forget your password, use the reset feature on the login page (if "
"available), or contact an administrator to reset it."

#: ../../docs/login/register.rst:73 87dd2f556a6c4c4bb5934a582f80ca3a
msgid "请使用真实邮箱注册，便于接收平台通知和密码找回邮件。"
msgstr ""
"Register with a valid email address so you can receive platform "
"notifications and password-recovery messages."
